            "step_number": 10,
            "title": "",
            "step_url": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Bathroom+Drawer+Slide+Replacement/<#s323510>",
            "instructions": [
                "As soon as all steps are complete, it is now time to push in your drawer; with no damage to the cabinets, the drawer will slide in easily."
