    "conclusion": {
        "text": "Now that your repair is done make sure your drawer is sliding smoothly if not you will need to remove it and clean the tracks. Another thing to look for is if the tracks are perfectly aligned if not you can go back in and fix them by following the same steps again.",
        "almost_done": "Enjoy your new drawer!"
    },
